                                                "sense_id": "993d4bf9-6b9c-39e7-95ba-59eb768a1f78",
                                                "text": "The NEET population in 2003, according to a Ministry of Health and Labor estimate last September, was 520,000."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00b8bdf7-ecd5-40a1-a8b4-d5a43f5474a4",
                                                "sense_id": "993d4bf9-6b9c-39e7-95ba-59eb768a1f78",
                                                "text": "Studies have shown that NEETs are usually between the ages of 18 to 40 years and may be the victims of family breakdown and mental illness, lack of discipline also contributes to the problem. […] Kudo says the centre offers a one-year programme for NEETS^([sic]) priced at more than 2,000 US dollars per month."
                                            }
